            <title>[MAHOUT-1953] jars in $MAHOUT_HOME should be deleted on mvn clean</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1953</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1950&quot; title=&quot;Unread Block Data in Spark Shell Pseudo Cluster&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-1950&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-1950&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; copies jars to $MAHOUT_HOME to be picked up.  &lt;/p&gt;

