                            <comment id="15987990" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 28 Apr 2017 01:23:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user rawkintrevo opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/312&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/mahout/pull/312&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-1953&quot; title=&quot;jars in $MAHOUT_HOME should be deleted on mvn clean&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;MAHOUT-1953&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;MAHOUT-1953&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Delete jars from MAHOUT_HOME&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Jars are coppied on `mvn package` to MAHOUT_HOME however, `mvn clean` does not delete this packages. &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    This corrects that oversite. &lt;/p&gt;


